    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n***Register Your Interest on www.merriongardens.com***\n\nMerrion Gardens by Seabren Developments is a secluded boutique development of just 8 luxury four bedroom homes located off the Merrion Road in the heart of Ballsbridge's embassy belt.\n\nEach of the homes at Merrion Gardens have been carefully planned with great attention to detail and will result in properties of exceptional elegance and craftsmanship. With most of the houses having the added benefit of a passenger lift this is a rare and exciting opportunity to acquire a new home in one of Dublin's most sought after locations.\n\nBallsbridge Dublin 4 is Dublins premier address and the convenience of the location cannot be overstated with an extensive choice of amenities on its doorstep. Some of these include The Intercontinental Hotel, The Merrion Shopping Centre, St Vincent's Private & Public hospitals, the RDS show grounds, Aviva stadium, Herbert Park, not to mention an excellent choice of restaurants including Roly's, the French Paradox and Kites.\n\nThere are also numerous sports clubs nearby such as Elm Park Golf Club, Wanderers RFC, Pembroke and Railway Unions Rugby and Cricket grounds. \n\nMany of Dublin's premier primary and secondary schools are also close by and there is an excellent choice of public transport within walking distance including Sydney Parade DART station.\n\nPlease contact our Sherry Fitzgerald Office on 01 6671888 for more information."
      },
